atforms easily create seasonal promotional resources at minimal cost:

- Netflix has several options, with themed fireplaces covering bases from K=
Pop Demon Hunters to =E2=80=9CBridgerton.=E2=80=9D

- HBO Max released a =E2=80=9CRick and Morty=E2=80=9D version that lets vie=
