<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%"><span style=3D"fon=
t-size: 22px;">Come gather round the TV fireplace, kids</span></h2>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Cocoa, caroling, your brother-in-law hiding t=
he Elf on the Shelf in some BS place no one will ever find=E2=80=A6 We all =
have our Christmas traditions.&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And, for many, those include a TV fireplace c=
rackling in the background.&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Popular on streaming platforms, TV fireplaces=
 capture some of a real fire's coziness, minus the smoke, cleanup, and risk=
 of burning your house down.&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">A merry tra=
dition</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">New York City TV station WPIX <a href=3D"http=
s://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXbwty1tWwRbW9lzP1M4MpNNHW20x=
2Jc5GCY-pN1YBntC2-ZW0W5BW0B06lZ3pYW4BW-3T1v5n2HVkkz924F_S3qV37jxk7xTqV5W55_=
Pzh8xtpVQW8rsc4G5RF50ZW6PqDK02lzr8qVs3l4q3HkkwgW789LSN2v1CxQV927lW3GWhFkW7Q=
zNhp79kJj6W5jDL6Y6JMZc4W2Gr9Pr9c1ClYW4p9sfK4_m1VTN2ZRbN8-Q7ZvW2TlXX12P4sDcW=
6FYd_c6qmgPSV2sW411pV_GkW6tyyqw1fyPGnf6c_H9F04" rel=3D"noopener" style=3D"c=
olor:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"DCOK37Ol" target=
=3D"_blank">ran</a> the first televised fireplace in 1966 =E2=80=94 =E2=80=
=9CThe Yule Log=E2=80=9D =E2=80=94 offering three uninterrupted hours of lo=
oped footage of a log burning on Christmas.&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Silly and celebrated, a tradition was born.&n=
bsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Initially, the program was cancelled in 1990 over fina=
ncial concerns. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">But after years of public pressure, the channel reboot=
ed it in 2001, and has aired it every Christmas since. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">In 2011, a similar series, "Fireplace for Your Home," =
directed by George Ford,&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/=
UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXbwty1tWwRbW9lzP1M4MpNNHW20x2Jc5GCY-pN1YBnvv2-ZW0W7lCdLW6l=
Z3pzVw7QT08PSHwSW5x7qKT4QS0N5W5r34sl2sjVSfW903kcJ4GVtY5W75mh1L8SDkkXW5x9SP9=
1WB1MJV5CWTF966Db0W8BX9vk3dphp2W7tGVR87LNkt-V2_zRJ9hkV2QW5KNgXl9cHWZjW6-fsD=
H3bpQ9sW3sZ2Hx1mxNNGW4xZFnH5XMLfVW1MG1KY1K7JtrW27ZCBB1vFmNHW6vWRhL8mbDs0N3l=
ZygQqqfv5W85cBCm1DWqkvW6sFDcn3tVVc8V6zh2G1nRxH3W344-FM3sdxx-W5Dr6vv53r2M7W7=
-9hJW2S-S6lf3ZL5-x04" rel=3D"noopener" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link=
-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"V6R5KXVI" target=3D"_blank">debuted</a> on =
Netflix.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Despite initial skepticism, Ford's videos bec=
ame some of the platform's most unlikely hits =E2=80=94 and one of the stre=
aming industry's quietest marketing hacks.&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">Isn't it ir=
onic?</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The original =E2=80=9CYule Log=E2=80=9D progr=
am is essentially anti-commercial. It's an uninterrupted, unprofitable gift=
 to New Yorkers =E2=80=94 but its modern-day descendants are some of stream=
ing's most versatile commercial assets.&nbsp;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">TV fireplaces tap into holiday nostalgia that=
 can generate serious engagement. Two versions even made <a href=3D"https:/=
/media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXbwty1tWwRbW9lzP1M4MpNNHW20x2Jc=
5GCY-pN1YBnvP2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3l1W2Zy3Jv2_m5BGW65RRKV4MB-XrW1-5_4q1cM0wgW58Nj=
J456chP7W3X4fNH37d0SJW4n2ZMD42cNgSW4pwxRq1fxgWPW6SKx-W4jxPCsW5TvKJ96VgDMGW7=
fvXPx5QGM-0W7Rj0906hhV4XW4lpKYl8DBFQxW5HShXx1L6rfMW6MT2gK16lL3DW7SSTQv86pzm=
YW2NnPdf692qw5Vkd5JV2b54VdW5gb9_P88c-BdVtnkjM2rG0W3W2LSJKJ5Vf1HxW5CbjNy4NJ4=
kLW2Qn99x6hvsM7VNYPrn93SPPFW817Fxk6xKFkxW918P6n9k83NLW12f02s8L-VlKf3313Xq04=
" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"g46q0=
506" target=3D"_blank">Netflix's Top 10</a> around this time last year.&nbs=
p;</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">They're also easy to produce with adjusted br=
anding, letting studios and platforms easily create seasonal promotional re=
sources at minimal cost:</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Netflix has several options, with themed fireplaces co=
vering bases from <em>KPop Demon Hunter</em>s to =E2=80=9CBridgerton.=E2=80=
=9D<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">HBO Max released a =E2=80=9CRick and Morty=E2=80=9D ve=
rsion that lets viewers join the titular duo fireside as they flip through =
interdimensional cable channels.&nbsp;<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Horror streaming service <a href=3D"https://media.hubs=
pot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VXbwty1tWwRbW9lzP1M4MpNNHW20x2Jc5GCY-pN1YBn=
vb2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3kQN6Sg4Q5THsccW1zczLM89KZzxW4Fhdrh23CTQ7W7Rwj7N4dCcZJW50d=
L5g3L3PJYW6nWlQ56z8p6hN97N-Mfb6mcjW2glTJP92P1C3W4y9mV54L800ZW254_BN2gSfxWW4=
TK6Wf7w0cDxW1C83N44CJTZ7W1cb-lb4dwL0CW4HWbJK8wlnN0W1F2phw81z82fW1h5lBw95GM0=
cW36Cl7q3ky6t9W1nBSSL7P65KYW3h1yCM74JZxZW8HsNTH5rmfMrW8CX3yY4q4f3ZW5vW0pp4B=
W1Nxf8Q93R404" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-i=
d-v2=3D"7BoOw978" target=3D"_blank">Shudder</a> offers a Halloween-themed T=
V fireplace called the "Ghoul Log" =E2=80=94 which gets a mention because t=
hat name slaps. <br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Even <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+1=
13/d2q-Vf04/VXbwty1tWwRbW9lzP1M4MpNNHW20x2Jc5GCY-pN1YBnw42-ZW0W8wLKSR6lZ3nG=
N3tPrtslwt1-V3-VlQ8bgfBNVppk5G7VrjRwW7TDxTK5yDhC_W233tcw7yM1RvVbVhcL225ZS2N=
1_Bys5M-YMmVSCBqk17Pn0jW343ZP-1JZ0CsVTYP_J1By0hMW2l13dd95MCS3W3t3KRg4zyLB4W=
4pVZ4w7KF8QgW3Hk_084tfm3xW69RlrD3PS3_bW7fSrTl8cGW3yW5070HK2jvyQlW9hXCfG307-=
D7W3zrfWl4Gb8p6W3BkvWY5wXNfCW985MND1QGQjxW1PLfw_6TGfvtW987WVQ8rfX10N78JXf4-=
