"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"eD9875Du" targe=
t=3D"_blank">NASA</a> got in on the action last year with four RS-25 rocket=
 engines ablaze in a fireplace.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The versatility and staying power of the TV f=
ireplace shows there can be value in unlikely, passively consumable sources=
 =E2=80=94 especially if they play to nostalgia and can be produced without=
 breaking the bank.&nbsp;</p>
