ized that every Fortune 500 company outsources, but very few small business=
es do. And the reason is the management and HR support. So I set off to fix=
 that.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><br><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">One tr=
uly innovative thing they=E2=80=99re doing: </span>=E2=80=9CWe give a small=
 business owner access to the same advantages of outsourcing that large cor=
porations are able to leverage. No freelancers. Actual long-term, college e=
