<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold;">One big wi=
n this year: </span>=E2=80=9CWe leaned into the medical office space with m=
ore technical positions like medical billing and coding.=E2=80=9D<br><br><s=
pan style=3D"font-weight: bold;">Advice to a fellow entrepreneur:</span> =
=E2=80=9CHarshly scrutinize everything on your schedule each day and ask yo=
urself =E2=80=98Do I really need to do this myself?=E2=80=99=E2=80=9D<br><b=
r></p>
